## Quality Check Rules

**All quality verification is done locally. CI is for build confirmation only.**

### Flow

```
Harness-only diff? -> skip quality-check entirely (the gate exempts it)
    |
Change area detection (git diff)
    |
Static checks + tests
    |
Review cycles (staged personas by diff size, min 1 cycle; repeat only on High/Medium findings)
    |
E2E tests (final verification)
    |
Report data saved -> .quality-check-passed (commit-bound JSON) created -> merge allowed
```

### Merge Gate

- The gate applies to `gh pr merge`, `git merge` on main, and direct pushes to main. **Pushes to feature branches are NOT gated** - push freely at any time.
- `.quality-check-passed` is commit-bound JSON (`{branch, commit}`) and is not consumed. It stays valid while post-check commits touch only harness files, so `self-improvement` edits never force a re-review.
- Harness-only diffs (`CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `.cursorrules`, `.claude/**`, `.codex/**`, `.cursor/**`, `skills/project/**`, `skills/superpowers/**`, `.github/review-*.md`, `documents/development/coding-rules/**`) skip the gate and the quality check entirely.

### Multi-Persona Review

Specialist personas review in parallel as Agents (each dispatched with `model: opus` - see Subagent Model Selection):

| Persona | Focus Area |
|---------|-----------|
| Security Engineer | Vulnerabilities, auth, data leaks, injection |
| Software Architect | SOLID/DRY, layer responsibilities, dependencies, extensibility |
| QA Engineer | Edge cases, test coverage, error handling |
| Integration Architecture | Overall consistency, layer dependencies, existing patterns, side effects |
| Performance Engineer | Algorithmic complexity, query performance, bundle size, caching |
| Requirements Consistency Reviewer | Issue/design alignment, acceptance criteria, domain terminology |

- **Completion criteria**: 0 must-fix items (Priority: High) from all applied personas
- Code changes under 200 diff lines (generated files excluded): 3 personas (Security, QA, Integration Architecture). 200+ lines: all 6 personas. Docs/infra-only changes: reduced persona set (see `quality-check` skill)
- Minimum 1 cycle. Run another cycle only if the previous one had High/Medium findings; repeat until 0 must-fix items
- After fixes, re-verify only the affected scope (static checks + related tests + re-check by the personas that raised the findings) - no full restart
- Run `self-improvement` before creating `.quality-check-passed`

